msgid ""
"Scan the QR code with an authenticator application on your phone, such as "
"Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator or FreeOTP, and enter the six-"
"digit verification code it shows."
msgstr ""
"Naskenujte QR kód ověřovací aplikací v telefonu, například Google "
